== Rules ==
* All games are {{Abbr/BO5}}.
* Settings: Standard settings by typing <code>/1on1 dm2 duel</code> - A matchtag is required to enable both players the ability to pause. Without it, the match is not pausable.
* Pause rules: Each player is allowed one pause per match, once you have used a pause and use it again, you have forfeited the map.
* WO's on maps/games are accepted as long as both players agree to such (skill gaps can be huge in groupstage).
* Servers: All games must be played on EU servers (unless players agree on something else).
* Antilag 1 is not allowed (unless players agree on something else).
* Ping rules: Find a server that keeps both players around the same ping +/- 13ms, if no such server can be found, the lowest ping player will have to use cl_delay_packet to get closer to the higher ping player. If there's a dispute in what server should be used, contact admin in discord.
* The above rule dont apply for non EU players with higher ping, a cl_delay_packet up to maximum 39 is enough for the low ping player.
* Clients: ezQuake 3.6.x. Also a request for unezQuake v1.1.4 has been approved.
** Remember to check with f_version
* Ruleset: smackdown/qcon
** Remember to check with f_ruleset
* Reporting: send screenshots in [http://discord.quake.world/ discord] channel: <mark>#dm2-duel</mark>.

